# Email Reader System (Laravel + n8n + MySQL + phpMyAdmin)

Complete Docker setup guide for reusable projects.

---

# Project Goal

Build a Docker-based system using:

- Laravel backend
- n8n automation platform
- Shared MySQL database
- phpMyAdmin
- Email processing workflow

Flow:

Email → n8n → Laravel API → MySQL

---

# Step 1: Create Project Structure

Create project:

```bash
mkdir "AI Email"
cd "AI Email"
```

Create folders:

```bash
mkdir laravel-app
mkdir mysql
mkdir mysql\init
mkdir n8n
```

Structure:

```txt
AI Email/
│
├── laravel-app/
├── mysql/
│   └── init/
├── n8n/
├── docker-compose.yml
└── .env
```

---

# Step 2: Install Laravel

PowerShell:

```powershell
docker run --rm -v "${PWD}/laravel-app:/app" -w /app composer:latest composer create-project laravel/laravel .
```

Verify:

```powershell
dir laravel-app
```

Expected:

```txt
artisan
app
bootstrap
config
routes
storage
vendor
```

---

# Step 3: Create Root .env

Create:

```powershell
New-Item .env
```

Add:

```env
MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=root123
MYSQL_DATABASE=email_reader
MYSQL_USER=appuser
MYSQL_PASSWORD=apppass

N8N_USER=admin
N8N_PASSWORD=admin123

APP_PORT=8000
N8N_PORT=5678
MYSQL_PORT=3306
PHPMYADMIN_PORT=8080
```

---

# Step 4: Create Laravel Dockerfile

Create:

laravel-app/Dockerfile

Add:

```dockerfile
FROM php:8.3-cli

RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y \
    git \
    unzip \
    zip \
    curl \
    libzip-dev \
    default-mysql-client

RUN docker-php-ext-install pdo pdo_mysql zip

COPY --from=composer:latest /usr/bin/composer /usr/bin/composer

WORKDIR /var/www

COPY . .

RUN composer install --ignore-platform-reqs

RUN chmod -R 777 storage bootstrap/cache

EXPOSE 8000

CMD sh -c "php artisan key:generate && php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000"
```

---

# Step 5: Configure Laravel Database

Open:

laravel-app/.env

Replace DB section:

```env
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=mysql
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=email_reader
DB_USERNAME=appuser
DB_PASSWORD=apppass
```

---

# Step 6: Create docker-compose.yml

Create root docker-compose.yml

```yaml
services:

  mysql:
    image: mysql:8
    container_name: email_mysql
    restart: unless-stopped

    environment:
      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: ${MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD}
      MYSQL_DATABASE: ${MYSQL_DATABASE}
      MYSQL_USER: ${MYSQL_USER}
      MYSQL_PASSWORD: ${MYSQL_PASSWORD}

    ports:
      - "${MYSQL_PORT}:3306"

    volumes:
      - mysql_data:/var/lib/mysql
      - ./mysql/init:/docker-entrypoint-initdb.d

    networks:
      - appnetwork


  phpmyadmin:
    image: phpmyadmin/phpmyadmin
    container_name: phpmyadmin

    restart: unless-stopped

    ports:
      - "${PHPMYADMIN_PORT}:80"

    environment:
      PMA_HOST: mysql
      PMA_PORT: 3306
      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: ${MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD}

    depends_on:
      - mysql

    networks:
      - appnetwork


  laravel:
    build:
      context: ./laravel-app

    container_name: laravel_app

    ports:
      - "${APP_PORT}:8000"

    volumes:
      - ./laravel-app:/var/www

    depends_on:
      - mysql

    networks:
      - appnetwork


  n8n:
    image: n8nio/n8n:latest

    container_name: n8n_app

    ports:
      - "${N8N_PORT}:5678"

    environment:
      DB_TYPE: mysqldb
      DB_MYSQLDB_HOST: mysql
      DB_MYSQLDB_DATABASE: ${MYSQL_DATABASE}
      DB_MYSQLDB_USER: ${MYSQL_USER}
      DB_MYSQLDB_PASSWORD: ${MYSQL_PASSWORD}

      N8N_BASIC_AUTH_ACTIVE: true
      N8N_BASIC_AUTH_USER: ${N8N_USER}
      N8N_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD: ${N8N_PASSWORD}

    volumes:
      - n8n_data:/home/node/.n8n

    depends_on:
      - mysql

    networks:
      - appnetwork

volumes:
  mysql_data:
  n8n_data:

networks:
  appnetwork:
```

---

# Step 7: Start System

```powershell
docker compose build --no-cache
docker compose up -d
```

Check:

```powershell
docker ps
```

---

# Step 8: Access URLs

Laravel:

http://localhost:8000

n8n:

http://localhost:5678

phpMyAdmin:

http://localhost:8080

n8n Login:

admin
admin123

MySQL:

root
root123

---

# Step 9: Create Email API

Create model:

```powershell
docker exec -it laravel_app php artisan make:model Email -m
```

Controller:

```powershell
docker exec -it laravel_app php artisan make:controller EmailController
```

API Route:

routes/api.php

```php
Route::post('/email/store',[EmailController::class,'store']);
```

Controller:

```php
public function store(Request $request)
{
Email::create([
'sender'=>$request->sender,
'subject'=>$request->subject,
'body'=>$request->body
]);

return response()->json([
'success'=>true
]);
}
```

---

# Step 10: n8n Workflow

Workflow:

IMAP Trigger
↓
Read Email
↓
HTTP Request
↓
Laravel API
↓
MySQL

POST:

http://laravel:8000/api/email/store

JSON:

```json
{
"sender":"{{$json.from}}",
"subject":"{{$json.subject}}",
"body":"{{$json.text}}"
}
```

---

# Daily Commands

Start:

```bash
docker compose up -d
```

Stop:

```bash
docker compose down
```

Rebuild:

```bash
docker compose build --no-cache
```

Logs:

```bash
docker logs laravel_app
```

